      "writtenOn": "2024-11-05T12:08:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e  is there a requirement that all DICE stages use the same algo?\n\nNo. At each stage, you can use any of the three[1][2] supported algorithms.\n\n\u003e Multi-algo\" means that our code supports more than one or that a given handover might use differ algos in different stages of its chain?\n\n\"multi-algo\" means that we are going to support all three algorithms in the leaf certificate of the handover, which will address issue b/341630707. We are not concerned with the choice of algorithm used in other stages of the chain.\n\nfyi this functionality is already supported in upstream DICE (aosp/3330415). However, it involves several API-breaking changes, so additional work is necessary to integrate it into AOSP.\n\n[1] https://pigweed.googlesource.com/open-dice/+/HEAD/docs/specification.md#digital-signatures\n[2] https://android.googlesource.com/platform/packages/modules/Virtualization/+/main/docs/pvm_dice_chain.md#key-derivation",
